{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quit your job, now an android maid will work in the warehouse instead of you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid Moving Boxes is a simple and short game where you have to work... as a box mover. But as a cute anime girl! An engaging physics-based game where you need to meet quotas set by unknown management to load boxes onto cargo ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/0fea2d157bad963db46fdf48e005f7eb.poster.avif?t=1766100510\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/0fea2d157bad963db46fdf48e005f7eb.webm?t=1766100510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/0fea2d157bad963db46fdf48e005f7eb.mp4?t=1766100510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boxes! Boxes, boxes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxes have character... they have a price. And they also store many different things - food, chemicals, or even gold. Management expects you to load a certain type of box to complete the given tasks. Or something like that. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/9fbb8eb05b374f66be3ce685ee7685f9.poster.avif?t=1766100510\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/9fbb8eb05b374f66be3ce685ee7685f9.webm?t=1766100510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/9fbb8eb05b374f66be3ce685ee7685f9.mp4?t=1766100510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drone assistant cleverly grabs and lifts cargo, if it has enough strength, but you need to be careful and cautious: boxes can break or damage other cargo! In addition to durability, weight, and price, they have... quirks... that can complicate your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/95a0cbc26fe43c9a71891823ed271dfe.poster.avif?t=1766100510\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/95a0cbc26fe43c9a71891823ed271dfe.webm?t=1766100510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/95a0cbc26fe43c9a71891823ed271dfe.mp4?t=1766100510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More fun together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have... a multiplayer mode for you and your friends so you can work in the warehouse together with your colleagues. In multiplayer mode, tasks are generated randomly, which means <span class=\"bb_strike\">your shift will last forever!</span> you and your friends can play as much as you want! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/6ea78da3e251779aa3c1614c631490ec.poster.avif?t=1766100510\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/6ea78da3e251779aa3c1614c631490ec.webm?t=1766100510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/6ea78da3e251779aa3c1614c631490ec.mp4?t=1766100510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't lift the cargo? Weakling. But we have a solution! With honestly earned money, you can buy upgrades that will increase your stats to complete our tasks. Some upgrades will simplify your workflow, while others will diversify it, for example, by unlocking a new way to grab cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/68f2ec6ddcf6b42ef7aa19d0168b8a21.avif?t=1766100510\" width=1560 height=556 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Day on the Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/b511503f05e5e299da4e9767a01ef39139106033.jpg"},{"name":"Bomb Squad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/a6c4442c2a3f4eed155dcd6246741bf31317950e.jpg"},{"name":"Cleansing the Void","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/b87af5191fd824b80f6c705c9664efd03296e831.jpg"},{"name":"Corporate Mogul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/ffc26e4a3ef18b8db7cd8466574af42dabb9649f.jpg"},{"name":"Employee of the Month","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/ee6e055dfb8179cdef7125bb439fa04a8ecc8cb2.jpg"},{"name":"Express Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/458bf2b2c899f78ba25603f643a5f040368b0b4d.jpg"},{"name":"First Paycheck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/1f524a1c09387b46a113d229d1db215ee23eda7b.jpg"},{"name":"Handle With Care","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/9eb4cd2fa2b4300081665e734ee92773c1091622.jpg"},{"name":"Heavy Lifter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/506e4ef0b5f4a2ffc7dd3ad51647abaa1ca1cdea.jpg"},{"name":"Last Second","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917620/18d46cb04b2b155efa5004b6cb03ea1b013f2163.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917620?t=1766100510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/f9db3bbf483df6297005d8f73e1c1812f408c39b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766100510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/e1693053aa46e23ea81a75d63387a2dbf34b3655/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766100510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/e1693053aa46e23ea81a75d63387a2dbf34b3655/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766100510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quit your job, now an android maid will work in the warehouse instead of you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maid Moving Boxes is a simple and short game where you have to work... as a box mover. But as a cute anime girl! An engaging physics-based game where you need to meet quotas set by unknown management to load boxes onto cargo ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917620/extras/0fea2d157bad963db46fdf48e005f7eb.